// Dialog :
"P2573658457" "So. It is done. To be honest, {VillainName}, I thought I would feel more. Happiness, maybe. Or peace? But there's none of that. All I feel is the same burning determination to wipe out all of Selestar's putrid kind. And that's just what I'm going to do."
