"P3426860472" "You may find this hard to believe, {VillainName}, but there are people out there just as dedicated to mage hunting as I am. One of them has gotten herself into a bit of trouble. And, as much as I believe in letting people stand on their own two feet, this woman is special. She's got a lust for the kill that nearly rivals my own. So I need you to save this fledgling mage hunter. Before the Circle manages to suck out her soul."
