// IntroString :
"P1357002862" "Normally, I don't involve myself with Longbow. They do their job, I do mine, and the fact that we're often fighting the same people never troubles anyone. But I've just learned that they have something I want, and that means today they're on my hit list. They have a large number of tomes detailing the demon summoning rituals used by the Circle of Thorns. I want those books, {VillainName}. I want you to get them for me."
// AcceptString :
"P2259483229" "Get the books"
// SendOffString :
"P121288961" "Those books will only make it easier for me to tear the Circle apart."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3416236136" "Steal the Circle tomes"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2640758069" "I want those tomes, {VillainName}, and I won't be satisfied until I get them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
